! macrocycle BOND/ANGLE = FERRIC QM-Seminario (replaces Yang); Fe-shell/torsions/impropers/vdW kept; types Ma-Me/NP/NO
HEM frcmod for NOS heme, ferric state (Fe(III)=True, charge=+0, mult=6) -- Yang 2016 HEB macrocycle + Seminario Fe-shell from B3LYP/[LANL2DZ+6-31G(d)] QM Hessian

MASS
FO   55.850    ! NEW: heme Fe (patched to FO/FR per state by build_hem_frcmod_v2.py)
NP   14.010    ! NEW: heme pyrrole N class 1 (NA, NC)
NO   14.010    ! NEW: heme pyrrole N class 2 (NB, ND)
Me   12.010  ! FORKED <- heme vinyl-beta C (ff14SB CX is protein-Calpha). renamed from VB to clear case-clash with pterin Vb
Md   12.010  ! FORKED <- heme vinyl-alpha C; off standard CY. value-identical to prior CY
Mc   12.010  ! FORKED <- heme meso-bridge C; off standard CD. value-identical to prior CD
Ma   12.010  ! FORKED <- heme pyrrole-alpha C; confines heme bonded terms off standard CC (His CG). value-identical to prior CC
Mb   12.010  ! FORKED <- heme beta-pyrrole C (parm10 CB is nucleic CB-CB 520/1.370; heme 418/1.357). renamed from Cp
CT   12.010    ! REAFFIRM: identical to ff14SB parm10.dat CT (sp3 aliphatic C); re-used for heme methyl C, Cys Cβ
HC    1.008    ! REAFFIRM: identical to ff14SB parm10.dat HC (aliphatic H, no electronegative neighbor); re-used for heme methyl H
SH   32.060    ! REAFFIRM: identical to ff14SB parm10.dat SH (Cys-thiol S); re-used for Cys Sγ (thiolate, custom RESP charge)

